WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,340 --> 00:00:07,700
I have remembered Miss Han’s love.

2
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:14,320
she woke up

3
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:19,010
I've been lying here for a few days

4
00:00:19,250 --> 00:00:20,290
Thank you for looking after them

5
00:00:20,410 --> 00:00:21,410
What's the use of just thanking you?

6
00:00:21,890 --> 00:00:23,610
You guys live and eat in my house

7
00:00:23,770 --> 00:00:24,690
Let's get something to pay off the bill.

8
00:00:26,130 --> 00:00:27,130
Captain, don't listen to her

9
00:00:27,450 --> 00:00:29,090
None of us have been working for her all night these days.

10
00:00:29,210 --> 00:00:30,530
Everything you eat and drink is earned by yourself.

11
00:00:30,610 --> 00:00:31,650
She didn't eat her in vain

12
00:00:32,430 --> 00:00:34,910
You still have the nerve to ask for someone else?

13
00:00:35,510 --> 00:00:37,230
You will work till death and no one will care about your food.

14
00:00:37,670 --> 00:00:38,590
I'm not in a hurry for supplies.

15
00:00:38,950 --> 00:00:40,710
Why don't I just thank you for saving my life?

16
00:00:41,110 --> 00:00:45,660
I can’t wait until we get back. I don’t want to leave without paying.

17
00:00:45,860 --> 00:00:47,020
Pay the outgoing fee first
